00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,400
Wou d'Uelzecht durech d'Wisen zéit,

2
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:15,500
Duerch d'Fielsen d'Sauer brécht,

3
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:24,600
