00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:48,600
Hei nidden alles won,

7
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:57,600
Ons Heemechtsland dat mir sou déif

8
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:04,900
An onsen Hierzer dron.

